\]

Square \(Q\) already has area \(4\text{ mm}^2\).

Add them:
\[
400 + 4 = 404\text{ mm}^2.
\]

The total area of squares \(P\) and \(Q\) is \(404 \mathrm{~mm}^{2}\).

