\[
p-3=\frac{1}{12}
\quad\Rightarrow\quad
p=\frac{1}{12}+3
\]

Write \(3\) with denominator 12:
\[
3=\frac{36}{12}
\]

So,
\[
p=\frac{1}{12}+\frac{36}{12}=\frac{37}{12}
\]

Therefore, \( p=\frac{37}{12} \).

