- \(a=1\), \(b=-8\), \(c=16\)
- Discriminant \(=(-8)^2-4(1)(16)=64-64=0\)

Since the discriminant is \(0\), this equation has exactly one solution (a repeated root).

The correct answer is \( t^{2}-8 t+16=0 \).

