Paul’s estimate:
\[
188.945 \div 15
\]
Here the denominator was decreased from \(15.3382\) to \(15\), while the numerator stayed the same. Dividing by a smaller number gives a larger quotient, so Paul’s estimate is also an overestimate.

Both Jo and Paul.

