At first, a small increase in speed would make the journey time rise quickly, but then it would increase more slowly, so the graph should curve and level off.

Also, if the speed is 0, the time would start at 0, so the graph should begin at the origin.

So the most likely graph is the curved graph that starts at the origin, rises steeply, and then levels off.

