- In the tens column, \(5 + 7 = 12\), so write down \(2\). Since I’m not carrying to the next column, I just leave the hundreds digit alone.
- In the hundreds column, \(2 + \star = 3\), so \(\star = 1\).
- In the thousands column, \(4 + 2 = 6\), which matches.

So the star should be \(1\).

