\]

Then work out the brackets:
\[
1+2=3
\]

So the expression becomes:
\[
12 \times 6 - 3
\]

Now do the subtraction from left to right after the multiplication, giving:
\[
72 - 3 = 36
\]

So the brackets should go here:
\[
12 \times 6-(1+2)
\]

