For the first equation, \(2l\) becomes \(6l\), so I change it to:
\[
6l+3m=13
\]

For the second equation, \(3l\) becomes \(6l\), so I change it to:
\[
6l+4m=17
\]

So the correct transformation is:
\[
\begin{array}{l}
6l+3m=13\\
6l+4m=17
\end{array}
\]

