\(
\frac{2}{5} \div 2
\)

target distractor:
\( \frac{4}{5} \)

misconception:
when dividing a fraction by an integer, multiplies the numerator by the integer

generated reasoning trace:
To divide \(\frac{2}{5}\) by \(2\), I multiply the numerator by \(2\) and keep the denominator the same.

\[
